# Convex backend (Kauri). The app now reads its profile (users:me) and its
# bound terminal (devices:myDevice) from the admin backend, TontiPro-Admin.
# Copy this file to .env.local (git-ignored; Expo loads it over .env) and pick
# one deployment:
#   - admin dev:         https://giddy-leopard-614.convex.cloud
#   - admin PR preview:  the URL in the Convex dashboard, preview "pr-<number>"
#   - admin production:  https://resilient-ocelot-308.eu-west-1.convex.cloud
# The old mobile deployment (posh-nightingale-973) still serves customers and
# transactions until phases 2 and 3 of docs/migration-to-admin-backend.md land,
# but it has no users:me, so sign-in no longer works against it.
EXPO_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=https://giddy-leopard-614.convex.cloud
